English summary: Vortexs Live 4.0 and later is proprietary, paid software with a
free trial. The source is published for review and personal builds only; you may
not redistribute it, remove or bypass the licence check, or create licence keys.
Versions up to and including 3.5 (released as StreamDelay) remain under the MIT
licence.

